    28	) -> SurfaceForcingOutput:
    29	    """Apply bulk formulas for air-sea fluxes.
    30	
    31	    Supports constant coefficients or stability-dependent MOST algorithms
    32	    (COARE 3.0 or Large & Yeager 2004) selected via ``cfg.bulk_scheme``.
    33	
    34	    Parameters
    35	    ----------
    36	    T, S : array (6, n, n, nlev)
    37	    z_coord : OceanZStarCoordinate
    38	    jacobian : array (6, n, n)
