     1	"""Smoke test for ocean subsurface SW penetration tendency.
     2	
     3	Tests that the two-band Paulson & Simpson (1977) absorption profile produces
     4	a finite, sane temperature tendency that integrates to ~Q_sw / (rho_0 c_sw)
     5	over the column when surface absorption is negligible at the bottom.
     6	
     7	Run with:
